# =========================================================================
# server_rate_limit — rust-old/src/server/rate_limit.rs.
#
# All seven oracle tests are plain `#[test]`s and all seven port. The rate is
# integer thousandths here, so the oracle's `RateLimitState::new(10.0, 5)` is
# `agnosai_rate_limit_new(10000, 5)`.
# =========================================================================

